cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SyntheticTumors, please cite the CVPR 2023 paper below."
title: "SyntheticTumors: label-free tumor synthesis for medical image segmentation"
abstract: "Official implementation of label-free liver tumor segmentation, in which synthetic tumors generated from handcrafted rules train segmentation models that match or exceed models trained on real annotated tumors."
type: software
